 independently adapt the knapsack algorithm to dynamically sort non-rotatable rectangles such that they would fit within another rectangular container.   I was inspired to create this by the pc game \"Kenshi\". The goal was to create an algorithm whereby an inventory would autosort itself to create space for any new item a user attempted to place with that inventory. After attempting to deduce a method independently, I checked the available pre-existing methods, and found that my solution resembles the \u201cguillotine heuristic\u201d.  It currently has a run time of O(\u22c5Height\u22c5Width\u22c5Items2).","topics":[],"score":221150,"global_rank":194886},{"name":"97joaquinhr/MatesComputacionales","owner":"97joaquinhr","html_url":"https://github.com/97joaquinhr/MatesComputacionales","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"C++","description":"Repositorio de proyectos del curso Matem\u00e1ticas Computacionales.","topics":[],"score":221148,"global_rank":194910},{"name":"markwal/home-assistant-io-library","owner":"markwal","html_url":"https://github.com/markwal/home-assistant-io-library","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Helper library for communicating from ESP32 Arduino to Home Assistant via MQTT","topics":[],"score":221144,"global_rank":194919},{"name":"rebeccarothschild/LightSculptures","owner":"rebeccarothschild","html_url":"https://github.com/rebeccarothschild/LightSculptures","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":221144,"global_rank":194951},{"name":"AsirAAlam/COP4520-Programming-Assignment-2","owner":"AsirAAlam","html_url":"https://github.com/AsirAAlam/COP4520-Programming-Assignment-2","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":221135,"global_rank":195070},{"name":"ysubbagh/prog4","owner":"ysubbagh","html_url":"https://github.com/ysubbagh/prog4","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0